┄ [E-Fn] A function evaluates its arguments, then its body. It is stuck when
┄ its precondition is false. Inside a formula it is its body, with no
┄ obligation ([E-Formula], [I8]).
function half(x : u32) : u32 := x ÷ 2
function ratio(a : u32, b : u32) ⊢ b ≠ 0 : u32 := a ÷ b
function twice(x : u32) : u32 := half(x) * 4

control apply(a : u32, b : u32) ■ { value {v : u32} }
⊤ ▷ ■ value {ratio(twice(a), b)}

control stated(a : u32, b : u32) ■ { ok }
⊤ ▷ ⊢ ratio(a, b) ≥ 0
⊤ ▷ ■ ok

//! run apply(10, 5) => done value {4}
//! run apply(10, 0) => stuck X7 E-Fn
//! run stated(1, 0) => done ok
